      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "DESIGN DECISION \u2014 the one to lead with\nTenant isolation is a SQL predicate applied BEFORE retrieval,\nnot a prompt instruction. A prompt can be talked out of it;\na WHERE clause cannot. Fails closed if the predicate is missing.",
      "originalText": "DESIGN DECISION \u2014 the one to lead with\nTenant isolation is a SQL predicate applied BEFORE retrieval,\nnot a prompt instruction. A prompt can be talked out of it;\na WHERE clause cannot. Fails closed if the predicate is missing.",
