      "updated": 1785000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ABLATION TABLE \u2014 build this, it is the interview asset\n  dense only            \u2192 recall@5 ___\n  + BM25 / RRF          \u2192 recall@5 ___\n  + cross-encoder rerank\u2192 recall@5 ___\nPlus a p50/p95 latency and $/query column per row.",
      "originalText": "ABLATION TABLE \u2014 build this, it is the interview asset\n  dense only            \u2192 recall@5 ___\n  + BM25 / RRF          \u2192 recall@5 ___\n  + cross-encoder rerank\u2192 recall@5 ___\nPlus a p50/p95 latency and $/query column per row.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "el961453550",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false
    },
