      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1488092660,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1825218722,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "WHAT BREAKS AT 10M DOCS (have this ready)\n~150M chunks x 1024 dims x 4 bytes \u2248 614 GB \u2014 the index stops fitting in RAM.\nFirst failure is memory, not the LLM. Then: the tenant filter turns ANN into a\nrecall cliff, and the cross-encoder becomes the latency floor.",
      "originalText": "WHAT BREAKS AT 10M DOCS (have this ready)\n~150M chunks x 1024 dims x 4 bytes \u2248 614 GB \u2014 the index stops fitting in RAM.\nFirst failure is memory, not the LLM. Then: the tenant filter turns ANN into a\nrecall cliff, and the cross-encoder becomes the latency floor.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "el1757143248",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
